OL,3,GNEWSACordon remains after '250kg WW2
OL,4,Amissile' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cordon remains in place for a second
OL,7,Fday after a suspected unexploded bomb
OL,8,Fwas found in a dock in Cornwall.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FFalmouth Docks at 09:15 BST on Monday
OL,12,Fafter a suspected 250kg (550lb)
OL,13,FAmerican World War Two missile was
OL,14,Ffound in the water, which resulted in a
OL,15,F300m (984ft) exclusion zone.
OL,17,FThe cordon has been reduced to cover
OL,18,Fjust the docks and waters around it.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
