OL,3,GNEWSACordon remains after '250kg WW2
OL,4,Amissile' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police said three
OL,7,Fresidential properties were evacuated
OL,8,Fas a precaution. Householders have been
OL,9,Fbeen able to return home, but the
OL,10,Fpublic is still being urged to stay
OL,11,Faway from restricted zones.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
